<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia falls to 1.777 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia falls to 1.777 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.777 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.772 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    October 17	   October 16</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.777		  1.772</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $4.25 million	    $4.73 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
